    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Make the other baby cry! Every hit fills their CRY meter. At 100% they burst into tears and you win the round.


    YOUR DIAPER IS YOUR ARMOUR: while you wear it, hits hurt 3x less and barely push you. It''s also your best weapon, but throw it and you''re exposed until someone picks it up (maybe them!).


    TOYS drop into the playroom: grab one to balance it on your head, then throw it without losing your diaper. DASH to slide under throws, and bump into the other baby to shove them and knock their toy loose.


    First to 2 rounds wins the match. Time up? The calmest baby wins.'
